        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 12.1 – General",
            "block_bbox": [
                138,
                239,
                405,
                267
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    138.0,
                    239.0
                ],
                [
                    405.0,
                    239.0
                ],
                [
                    405.0,
                    267.0
                ],
                [
                    138.0,
                    267.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Parties agree that a genuine effort will be made to settle grievances expeditiously and at the lowest level possible. The Parties further agree, when appropriate, to utilize alternative dispute resolution processes (e.g., mediation) in attempting to resolve grievances.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                295,
                1008,
                410
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    295.0
                ],
                [
                    1008.0,
                    295.0
                ],
                [
                    1008.0,
                    410.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    410.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. This grievance procedure will be the exclusive method of grievance resolution for Bargaining Unit Employees. Examples of a grievance are as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                433,
                1043,
                493
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    433.0
                ],
                [
                    1043.0,
                    433.0
                ],
                [
                    1043.0,
                    493.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    493.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Any complaint by any Employee concerning any matter relating to the employment of the Employee;",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                518,
                950,
                576
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    136.0,
                    518.0
                ],
                [
                    950.0,
                    518.0
                ],
                [
                    950.0,
                    576.0
                ],
                [
                    136.0,
                    576.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Any complaint by the Union concerning any matter relating to the employment of any Employee; or",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                600,
                1087,
                660
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    135.0,
                    600.0
                ],
                [
                    1087.0,
                    600.0
                ],
                [
                    1087.0,
                    660.0
                ],
                [
                    135.0,
                    660.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. By any Employee, the Union, or the Employer concerning:",
            "block_bbox": [
                170,
                683,
                825,
                715
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    170.0,
                    683.0
                ],
                [
                    825.0,
                    683.0
                ],
                [
                    825.0,
                    715.0
                ],
                [
                    170.0,
                    715.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(i) The effect or interpretation, or a claim of breach of the terms of this agreement; or",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                739,
                959,
                797
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    739.0
                ],
                [
                    959.0,
                    739.0
                ],
                [
                    959.0,
                    797.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    797.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(ii) Any claimed violation, misinterpretation, or application of any law, rule, or regulation affecting conditions of employment.",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
                823,
                1085,
                882
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    133.0,
                    823.0
                ],
                [
                    1085.0,
                    823.0
                ],
                [
                    1085.0,
                    882.0
                ],
                [
                    133.0,
                    882.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The Employee retains the right to request Union representation in the grievance procedure, or to decline such representation. Employees will indicate their representation preference on the Grievance Form.",
            "block_bbox": [
                133,
                905,
                1027,
                993
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    133.0,
                    905.0
                ],
                [
                    1026.0,
                    905.0
                ],
                [
                    1026.0,
                    985.0
                ],
                [
                    133.0,
                    985.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Regardless of Employee representation option, the Union will be given the opportunity to be present during all grievance proceedings to represent the Local and to ensure that any relief granted as a result of the grievance process is not inconsistent with the terms of this agreement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                1017,
                1080,
                1131
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
